{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運硬地滾球賽事，港隊增添一面金牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n梁育榮和張沅在混合BC4級雙打決賽， 以9:0擊敗國家隊奪金。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港隊在硬地滾球項目合共取得兩金三銀三銅佳績。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：汪溟曦\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:04:35.533940+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T04:24:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T20:58:31.814026+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T04:58:28.445228+00:00","content_hash":"028e190092eed4e240e0d4917b01a5b24967d012a50485a5558ce971c3cb7725","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}